# Deployment excludes (Vercel CLI respects this file in addition to .gitignore)
# Rationale: ordinary files in the project root ARE served publicly as static assets
# (verified: a canary.txt was fetchable with 200), so never let local secrets ship.
# Verified 2026-10-03: canary.txt -> 200 (not excluded), canary.log -> 401 (*.log excluded).
.env*
node_modules
*.log
